              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eleazar, Aaron's son, married one of Putiel's daughters, who bore him Phinehas. These were the heads of the families and the clans of the tribe of Levi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
